# Outpace Oblivion: "It deals 2 damage to each player who doesn't have max speed". Bot1 casts it on turn 1 (speed 1) and a Memnite
# attacks on turns 3, 5 and 7, each hit raising the speed once (2, 3, then 4 = max speed) and taking Bot2 to 17. In the second main phase
# of turn 7 Bot1 pays {2} and sacrifices it: Bot1 has max speed and takes nothing (20), Bot2 takes 2 (15).

